WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.232 --> 00:00:16.816
Later afternoon the Green Club was finishing work for the day when Mr.

2
00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:19.797
Freaky arrived.

3
00:00:21.638 --> 00:00:25.879
He was dressed in golfing clothes and carrying a bag of golf clubs on his shoulder.

4
00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:27.899
"What's he doing here?"

5
00:00:28.139 --> 00:00:28.860
Ben wondered.

6
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.600
"Hi, Mr.

7
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.818
Freaky!" Ben floated over to the principal.

8
00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.819
"I didn't know you play golf."

9
00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:38.422
"I do when I want to talk to Mayor Hubbletree.

10
00:00:38.962 --> 00:00:42.645
We just finished playing a round at Monsterville Links," Mr.

11
00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:43.686
Freaky explained.

12
00:00:43.706 --> 00:00:45.528
"And I have good news!

13
00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:49.171
The mayor has agreed to officiate at the wedding."

14
00:00:49.191 --> 00:00:51.693
"Wow!" Ben said.

15
00:00:51.713 --> 00:00:54.655
"Uncle Bert and Victoria will be happy to hear that."

16
00:00:56.316 --> 00:01:00.680
"This is going to be the biggest event in Monster Academy history!"

17
00:01:01.332 --> 00:01:03.434
Mr. Freaky's three noses wiggled.

18
00:01:03.454 --> 00:01:10.621
"We'll have TV cameras and Hollyweird reporters—everyone will want to see all the monster movie stars at the

19
00:01:10.661 --> 00:01:17.768
wedding. And Monster Academy is going to look fabulous, thanks to the Green Club's new garden!"

20
00:01:17.788 --> 00:01:21.792
"As long as it's ready in time," Ben thought.

21
00:01:21.812 --> 00:01:24.575
"Hey, Ben, come see this!"

22
00:01:25.015 --> 00:01:25.716
Jen called.

23
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:31.161
She was planting flowers with Winnie and a skeleton for the field of black-and-orange flowers.

24
00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:32.922
"Be right there!"

25
00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:34.202
Ben called back.

26
00:01:34.222 --> 00:01:36.443
"Well, thanks for stopping by, Mr.

27
00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:40.004
Freaky." "I'm not leaving until I get a tour of the garden."

28
00:01:40.684 --> 00:01:44.125
Mr. Freaky put his bag of golf clubs down and followed Ben.

29
00:01:44.145 --> 00:01:47.446
"Sure," Ben said.

30
00:01:47.466 --> 00:01:49.166
"But there's not much to see.

31
00:01:49.386 --> 00:01:50.347
We're just getting started."

32
00:01:50.367 --> 00:01:54.068
"You're farther along than I ever got at home," Mr.

33
00:01:54.128 --> 00:01:54.848
Freaky said.

34
00:01:55.904 --> 00:01:59.047
"At least you don't have pests nibbling on everything."

35
00:02:01.709 --> 00:02:04.091
Ben forced a laugh, thinking about his map.

36
00:02:10.156 --> 00:02:11.377
First Ben and Mr.

37
00:02:11.417 --> 00:02:13.419
Freaky checked out the field of flowers.

38
00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:19.123
Waldo had fertilized some of them, and a few already had tiny buds.

39
00:02:19.143 --> 00:02:24.588
"All the flowers should start blooming by next week," Jen said.

40
00:02:25.364 --> 00:02:27.625
"Right on time for the wedding," Winnie added.

41
00:02:27.645 --> 00:02:30.247
"Wonderful!" Mr.

42
00:02:30.307 --> 00:02:31.067
Freaky said.

43
00:02:32.288 --> 00:02:37.351
Next they watched Mog and the fish monster finish filling the piranha pond with water.

44
00:02:37.371 --> 00:02:42.373
"We're almost ready to put the piranhas in," Mog said.

45
00:02:42.393 --> 00:02:45.735
"Then we'll work on planting stuff around the pond."

46
00:02:51.819 --> 00:02:54.060
are those zombies sleeping on?"

47
00:02:55.452 --> 00:02:58.514
Mr. Freaky pointed to the archway Ben had designed.

48
00:02:58.534 --> 00:03:01.757
"An archway," Ben said.

49
00:03:01.777 --> 00:03:04.459
"The zombies are helping Sid and me build it.

50
00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.163
My uncle wants me to train the bruised blue roses to grow up the latticework.

51
00:03:10.883 --> 00:03:13.145
Bruised blue roses are Victoria's favorite."

52
00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:17.448
"Very impressive," Mr.

53
00:03:17.508 --> 00:03:18.208
Freaky said.

54
00:03:18.228 --> 00:03:20.910
"Thanks." Ben smiled.

55
00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.192
Things were going pretty well so far.

56
00:03:25.452 --> 00:03:30.636
But when they went to check on Waldo and the ground creeper vines, Ben felt a fresh pang

57
00:03:30.676 --> 00:03:31.217
of worry.

58
00:03:32.518 --> 00:03:37.582
Waldo and others had just finished planting the vines, and most of the plants looked pretty tiny.

59
00:03:37.602 --> 00:03:40.845
"Did you fertilize them yet?"

60
00:03:41.085 --> 00:03:41.806
Ben asked.

61
00:03:41.826 --> 00:03:44.748
"Yep, I used just the right amount."

62
00:03:45.869 --> 00:03:48.111
Waldo showed Ben the bottle of fertilizer.

63
00:03:48.131 --> 00:03:50.393
"It may take a while, but you'll see.

64
00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:53.776
Once they start growing, they're going to look great."

65
00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.702
"I sure hope so," Ben said.

66
00:03:56.722 --> 00:03:59.324
"You kids keep up the good work."

67
00:04:02.687 --> 00:04:05.089
Mr. Freaky picked up his bag of golf clubs.

68
00:04:05.109 --> 00:04:09.012
"I'm going home now to—" Whoosh!

69
00:04:09.452 --> 00:04:11.674
A golf club suddenly flew out of his bag.

70
00:04:12.575 --> 00:04:16.018
Monsters laughed as the club danced crazily through the air.

71
00:04:16.038 --> 00:04:21.883
"Mr. Freaky, how do you make your golf club do that?"

72
00:04:22.323 --> 00:04:23.164
Mog asked.

73
00:04:23.748 --> 00:04:25.189
"I'm not doing anything!"

74
00:04:25.529 --> 00:04:26.589
Mr. Freaky said.

75
00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.831
The club danced around for a few more seconds.

76
00:04:31.031 --> 00:04:34.593
Then it flew through the air and crashed into the half-built archway.

77
00:04:35.073 --> 00:04:37.234
Splinters of wood flew everywhere.

78
00:04:38.574 --> 00:04:42.636
Ben ran over to pick up the golf club and heard a sniffling sound.

79
00:04:45.217 --> 00:04:46.098
He looked around.

80
00:04:46.118 --> 00:04:48.859
"Sid? Is that you?"

81
00:04:48.879 --> 00:04:56.498
"Yes." Sid slowly turned visible, wiping tears from his eyes.

82
00:04:56.518 --> 00:04:57.899
"I'm sorry."

83
00:04:58.879 --> 00:04:59.580
He sniffed.

84
00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:04.422
"I was trying to be scary in my own way, so I went invisible and grabbed the golf

85
00:05:04.462 --> 00:05:07.664
club. But it flew out of my hand and hit the archway.

86
00:05:07.684 --> 00:05:10.366
And everybody was laughing at me.

87
00:05:10.386 --> 00:05:12.167
I didn't scare anyone!"

88
00:05:12.187 --> 00:05:16.109
A few other monsters hurried over.

89
00:05:16.129 --> 00:05:18.610
"Don't cry, Sid."

90
00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.651
Winnie comforted him with a hug.

91
00:05:20.671 --> 00:05:22.853
"Yeah," Mog said.

92
00:05:22.873 --> 00:05:24.854
"You'll be scary someday."

93
00:05:27.235 --> 00:05:27.775
After Mr.

94
00:05:27.835 --> 00:05:30.557
Freaky had left, everyone started cleaning up.

95
00:05:31.377 --> 00:05:35.460
Ben was pushing the wheelbarrow toward the shed when he felt the ground shaking.

96
00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.521
"Hey, Gaby," Ben called over his shoulder.

97
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:40.663
"Can you please stop jumping?

98
00:05:40.743 --> 00:05:43.024
It's really hard to push this wheelbarrow!"

99
00:05:43.044 --> 00:05:45.986
"It's not me," Gaby called back.

100
00:05:46.006 --> 00:05:49.848
"Maybe a truck went by," the fish monster said.

101
00:05:50.508 --> 00:05:52.470
But the shaking got stronger.

102
00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:57.193
"It's ra-ra-rattling my bones!"

103
00:05:57.773 --> 00:05:58.834
the skeleton cried.

104
00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:01.415
"Yikes!" Jen cried.

105
00:06:01.435 --> 00:06:03.577
Ben looked where Jen was pointing.

106
00:06:04.217 --> 00:06:06.859
A giant sinkhole was opening up in the ground.

107
00:06:06.879 --> 00:06:09.381
"Oh no!"

108
00:06:09.781 --> 00:06:12.623
Mog cried as a loud sucking sound filled the air.

109
00:06:17.066 --> 00:06:19.928
sinkhole just swallowed our piranha pond!"
